e near to the sea of Galilee; and went up into a mountain, and sat down there.", "words": [[0, 184629], [4, 184756], [10, 185036], [19, 185556], [24, 185836], [31, 186076], [35, 186436], [40, 186636], [45, 186856], [48, 187016], [52, 187116], [56, 187336], [59, 187436], [68, 188359], [72, 188639], [77, 188799], [80, 189019], [85, 189199], [87, 189359], [97, 189599], [101, 189979], [105, 190199], [110, 190479]]}, {"verse": 30, "start": 191307, "end": 201768, "text": "And great multitudes came to him, having with them those that were lame, blind, dumb, maimed, and many others, and cast them down at Jesus’ feet; and he healed them:", "words": [[0, 191307], [4, 191457], [10, 191717], [21, 192357], [26, 192617], [29, 192817], [34, 193397], [41, 193617], [46, 193897], [51, 194117], [57, 194377], [62, 194617], [67, 194737], [73, 195577], [80, 196157], [86, 196937], [94, 197357], [98, 197637], [103, 197857], [111, 198657], [115, 198797], [120, 199057], [125, 199297], [130, 199517], [133, 199697], [140, 200237], [146, 200845], [150, 200987], [153, 201127], [160, 201407]]}, {"verse": 31, "start": 202218, "end": 212768, "text": "So that the multitude wondered, when they saw the dumb to speak, the maimed to be whole, the lame to walk, and the blind to see: and they glorified the God of Israel.", "words": [[0, 202218], [3, 202358], [8, 202518], [12, 202638], [22, 203018], [32, 203918], [37, 204078], [42, 204258], [46, 204478], [50, 204638], [55, 204918], [58, 205118], [65, 205978], [69, 206078], [76, 206518], [79, 206678], [82, 206838], [89, 207678], [93, 207738], [98, 207978], [101, 208238], [107, 208978], [111, 209118], [115, 209218], [121, 209558], [124, 209878], [129, 210701], [133, 210838], [138, 210918], [148, 211558], [152, 211758], [156, 212018], [159, 212178]]}, {"verse": 32, "start": 213218, "end": 226407, "text": "¶ Then Jesus called his disciples to him, and said, I have compassion on the multitude, because they continue with me now three days, and have nothing to ea