e seven loaves and the fishes, and gave thanks, and broke them, and gave to his disciples, and the disciples to the multitude.", "words": [[0, 243865], [4, 243986], [7, 244086], [12, 244266], [16, 244466], [22, 244766], [29, 245266], [33, 245406], [37, 245506], [45, 246286], [49, 246526], [54, 246746], [62, 247666], [66, 247726], [72, 248026], [78, 248786], [82, 248866], [87, 249106], [90, 249306], [94, 249466], [105, 250466], [109, 250626], [113, 250726], [123, 251206], [126, 251486], [130, 251626]]}, {"verse": 37, "start": 252876, "end": 259300, "text": "And they did all eat, and were filled: and they took up of the broken food that was left seven baskets full.", "words": [[0, 252876], [4, 253025], [9, 253145], [13, 253365], [17, 253685], [22, 254005], [26, 254385], [31, 254545], [39, 255417], [43, 255569], [48, 255669], [53, 255889], [56, 256109], [59, 256269], [63, 256409], [70, 256709], [75, 257089], [80, 257289], [84, 257469], [89, 257729], [95, 258149], [103, 258669]]}, {"verse": 38, "start": 259750, "end": 264079, "text": "And they that did eat were four thousand men, beside women and children.", "words": [[0, 259750], [4, 259914], [9, 260054], [14, 260334], [18, 260554], [22, 260854], [27, 261181], [32, 261507], [41, 261834], [46, 262174], [53, 262774], [59, 263234], [63, 263454]]}, {"verse": 39, "start": 264529, "end": 269229, "text": "And he sent away the multitude, and took ship, and came into the coasts of Magdala.", "words": [[0, 264529], [4, 264664], [7, 264784], [12, 265044], [17, 265284], [21, 265484], [32, 265904], [36, 266344], [41, 266564], [47, 266884], [51, 267444], [56, 267684], [61, 267884], [65, 268024], [72, 268484], [75, 268564]]}]}